abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of CATT-RL, a PPO-trained, transaction-aware
  portfolio-allocation policy with Context-Aware Temporal Transformer blocks,
  pre-attention instance normalization, a lightweight gating unit, and a
  bounded memory trajectory.
